OL,3,GNEWSANew rules introduced for residency
OL,4,Aand employment
OL,5,
OL,6,FNew rules for residency and employment
OL,7,Frights have been brought in.
OL,9,FThe government said the new laws would
OL,10,Fmake it easier for islanders to build
OL,11,Fand maintain their residency status and
OL,12,Ffor businesses to recruit staff.
OL,14,FLong-term islanders can now qualify for
OL,15,FPermanent Entitled status after 25
OL,16,Fyears of continuous residence, rather
OL,17,Fthan the 30 years previously required.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
