OL,3,GNEWSANew rules introduced for residency
OL,4,Aand employment
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt is hoped a more streamlined system
OL,7,Fwith shorter forms for business licence
OL,8,Fand staffing applications, along with
OL,9,Fclearer guidance and fewer information
OL,10,Frequirements will make it easier to
OL,11,Frecruit staff.
